description:
I have a tool that uses a list of Ids from information_schema.tables. It stopped working with MariaDB since it depended on the dbQuoteIdentifier removing the catalog ("def"). Would you consider the following implementation?

```r
dbQuoteIdentifier_MariaDBConnection_Id <- function(conn, x, ...) {
  if (length(name <- x@name) == 3L && name[[1L]] == "def") {
    name <- name[-1L]
  }

  SQL(paste0(dbQuoteIdentifier(conn, name), collapse = "."))
}
```
